      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m sorry that I provided wrong information. Actually, the flag is ro_at_boot ON but all bank didn\u0027t protect now (test on patchset 17). [flashinfo](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/flash.c;l\u003d1288) command call `crec_flash_physical_get_protect()` directly and it was block by `software_protection_lock`.\n```\nfpmcu:~$ flashinfo\nUsable:   536 KB\nWrite:     16 B (ideal 16 B)\nErase:   8192 B (to 1-bits)\nProtect: 8192 B\ncrec_flash_get_protect clear RW_NOW flags\u003d0\ncrec_flash_get_protect flags\u003d0\n[28.586000] \u003cinf\u003e cros_flash: protect start\u003d0x0 end\u003d0x20000\n[28.592000] \u003cinf\u003e cros_flash: cros_flash_em32f967_get_protect_flags flags\u003d0x1.\nFlags:\n  wp_gpio_asserted: OFF\n  ro_at_boot: ON\n  all_at_boot: OFF\n  ro_now: OFF\n  all_now: OFF\n  STUCK: OFF\n  INCONSISTENT: OFF\n  UNKNOWN_ERROR: OFF\n  rollback_at_boot: OFF\n  rollback_now: OFF\nProtected now:\n    ........ ........ ........ ........\n    ........ ........ ........ ........\n    ...\n```",
      "parentUuid": "287fafec_c82de5c5",
