      "writtenOn": "2026-04-29T08:12:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed. Since physical_get_protect is used as a boolean predicate,\nreturning any non-zero value would be interpreted as \"protected\".\nWhen the write-protect library is not available, returning 0 is the\nsafest and most correct behavior.\n\nget_prot_reg() is only called from paths that already verify the\nwrite-protect library is enabled. The helper assumes that invariant\nand focuses solely on validating the hardware protection state.",
